! The House of Masks

''Stratum:'' High Delos, the Theatre Quarter · ''Scale:'' Site (one maze-block).

The levitated House of Masks of old Delos's Theatre Quarter: a maze-block merchant house —
shops, workshops, living quarters in one building — floored with theatrical-mask mosaics, the
cabaret's main room keeping the Dionysos-on-panther masterwork the speakeasy hid under boards.
Order of Amaranth management; trusted neutral ground; near the main lifts. The whisper-trade
holds the Masks control private liminal ways below.

''The Conclave Room:'' the first DreamNet
conclave of YOLD 5002 convened in ''a hidden astral-dream-realm hoard-room connected to the
House of Masks'' — and the old low door by stage-left, the one that breathes sea-air at
altitude, may stand as its threshold ("the door" the Patroness uses). If the feel holds, the
cabaret was never merely the conclave's grandchild: it stands built OVER the conclave's own
room, and the squabbling immortals of the founding walked in past the same masks the summit's
guests pass now.

''Full canon rides the campaign locus:'' `lar:///ha.ka.ba/elyncia/campaign/high-delos-cabaret`
— venue history, the summit, the genre compass, the casting sheet. This record keeps the
place's seat on the map; that locus keeps its life.

